From 7c41727e3ae42b89da24bd9a51c3e27e13ba6f92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:51:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: CI pytest-cov args + bandit medium/high findings
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CI fix
- Remove invalid --cov-omit flag (not supported in pytest-cov 7.x)
- Add .coveragerc with omit patterns; CI command now just uses --cov=.

Bandit security scan (0 medium+high with -ll -ii after this commit)
- B608 (SQL injection): add # nosec B608 on 14 parameterized f-string
  queries in executor.py, connector_utils.py, migrate_to_postgres.py,
  tenancy.py — placeholders are "?,?.." built from len() or internal
  TABLES/TENANT_TABLES constants, never from user input
- B310 (urlopen): add # nosec B310 on HTTPS-only constants in
  sendgrid_email.py and agent/planner.py
- B104 (bind all interfaces): add # nosec B104 on api.py uvicorn line —
  intentional for Railway/Docker containers
- B105/B107 (hardcoded password): add # nosec on salesforce_connector.py
  empty-string OAuth placeholders, not real passwords
- B113 (no timeout): add timeout=30 to all requests.get/post calls in
  hubspot, intercom, razorpay, salesforce connectors
- B110 (try/except/pass): replace silent pass with logging.debug in
  approval.py get_trust_mode and get_approval_log fallback paths

Tests: 87 passed, 1 skipped

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cz64KwHkF4CaTaX2Zqqga2
